iterations.reply:
The http-client import is removed. The node's `with` clause grants only `StateHandle<'seen', read-write>`, and the linker enforces that clause. A note that the platform team has approved the change does not alter it. When the graph definition is updated to grant `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`, the enrichment fetch can be added back. The output is the same as before, so `recorded >= 0` still holds.

